knix-fedora-remix-logos - Knix Fedora Remix logos
=========================================================

The knix-fedora-remix-logos package contains various image files
which can be used by the bootloader, anaconda, and other related
tools.

If you are unable to abide by the trademark restrictions for any
reason with the knix-fedora-remix-logos package, you can use the
generic-logos package instead.

Homepage: https://pagure.io/fedora-knix/knix-fedora-remix-logos

knix-fedora-remix-logos is licensed under CC-BY-SA, check LICENSE
for more details.
